--- !u!114 &1900973101
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1900973099}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> TicTacToeBoardService.TryMakeMove
    / ResetBoard / WinLineLength / WinningLine, FieldGenerator.SetWalkable / SetEnabled
    / GenerateField, OnCellStateChanged for views.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select GridSystem_TicTacToe: FieldGenerator (size, movement
    preset) and TicTacToeBoardService (Reset On Start, Win Line Length); its events
    are wired to GridSystemTicTacToeDemoUI in the Inspector.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Play: three in a row lights the winning line (WinningLine);
    a full board is a draw; a blocked center cannot be played.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color> 
    Reset board -> TicTacToeBoardService.ResetBoard directly (no script): see the
    button's OnClick.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color>  OnPlayerChanged / OnWinnerDetected
    / OnDrawDetected -> GridSystemTicTacToeDemoUI on 'GridSystemTicTacToeDemoUI'.\n<color=#40C9F0>\xBB</color> 
    The view redraws single cells from FieldGenerator.OnCellStateChanged, raised
    by the service."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
